msgid "not set"
msgstr "niet gezet"

msgid ""
"No RTC in\n"
"this bitstream.\n"
"\n"
"Enable `RTC in\n"
"rtl/boards.vh\n"
"then: make flash"
msgstr ""
"Geen RTC in\n"
"deze bitstream.\n"
"\n"
"Zet `RTC aan in\n"
"rtl/boards.vh,\n"
"dan: make flash"

msgid ""
"A wall clock, analog or digital.\n"
"\n"
"Tab, arrows\tChoose Analog, Digital or Zone\n"
"Enter/Space\tPress it\n"
"z\tThe time zone: settings\n"
"\n"
"Or click the buttons. The time comes from the RTC, which net sets over NTP; until then it shows no time. The time zone is set in settings -- Zone opens it -- and shown under the digital time."
msgstr ""
"Een wandklok, analoog of digitaal.\n"
"\n"
"Tab, pijlen\tKies Analoog, Digitaal of Zone\n"
"Enter/Spatie\tIndrukken\n"
"z\tDe tijdzone: settings\n"
"\n"
"Of klik op de knoppen. De tijd komt van de RTC, die net via NTP zet; tot dan toont de klok geen tijd. De tijdzone stel je in settings in -- Zone opent het -- en ze staat onder de digitale tijd."

msgid "Clock help"
msgstr "Hulp bij clock"

msgid "Analog"
msgstr "Analoog"

msgid "Digital"
msgstr "Digitaal"

msgid "Zone"
msgstr "Zone"
